  <readme><![CDATA[
# Microsoft Copilot

Microsoft's flagship chat web UI at [copilot.microsoft.com](https://copilot.microsoft.com).
The browser bridge drives the logged-in Microsoft account session — your
existing Microsoft 365 / Copilot Pro subscription is the rate limiter,
no per-token API fees.

**Models typically exposed** (subject to discovery on first login):

  - GPT-4 / GPT-4o — OpenAI-backed default (free + Pro tiers)
  - GPT-5 reasoning — Copilot Pro flagship
  - "Think Deeper" — multi-step reasoning mode
  - Designer / DALL-E 3 — image generation

**First-time setup:** sign in with a personal Microsoft account (Outlook /
Hotmail / Xbox) or a work / school account. Copilot Pro unlocks priority
GPT-4o access and the higher-reasoning models; the free tier still works
fine for ordinary chat.
  ]]></readme>

